  "markdown": "The Wallcovering Guide · Choose and source\n\n# Calico Wallpaper\n\nCalico Wallpaper creates non-repeating murals from handmade patterns and digital enlargement. Its designs explore marbling, gradients, metallic effects and woven natural fibres. Mural panels, samples and custom layouts follow different ordering processes.\n\n## Source evidence\n\nRead the maker’s information for the selected product and destination. A brand profile does not certify a seller or prove that an order will be accepted.\n\n- [Official source: calicowallpaper.com/about/our-story](https://calicowallpaper.com/about/our-story/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: calicowallpaper.com/about/faqs](https://calicowallpaper.com/about/faqs/) — checked 17 October 2026\n- [Official source: calicowallpaper.com/about/contact](https://calicowallpaper.com/about/contact/) — checked 17 October 2026\n\n[Visit maker website](https://calicowallpaper.com/)\n\n## Official sourcing routes\n\nCheck the route’s scope before ordering. Showrooms, samples and finder links do not establish a roll checkout or delivery promise.\n\n### Shop or product ordering\n\nUse the maker's mural and sample ordering process described in its FAQ.\n\n**Region**\n: US; international mural orders stated, UK acceptance unconfirmed\n\n**UK access**\n: International statement is not specific proof of UK delivery.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: International mural shipping expressly stated; destinations require confirmation.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nSamples selectable by style, substrate and size. Trade discounts and complimentary samples are for qualifying accounts; international taxes/duties may be payable by purchaser.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Shop or product ordering, US; international mural orders stated, UK acceptance unconfirmed](https://calicowallpaper.com/)\n\n### Showroom or brand contact\n\nContact the sales team or schedule a showroom appointment.\n\n**Region**\n: New York, US; remote sales enquiry\n\n**UK access**\n: UK visitors can use the contact channel to ask; UK supply remains unconfirmed.\n\n**Overseas access**\n: New York visit route evidenced; overseas fulfilment must be agreed.\n\nMaker-published information; confirm current eligibility and destination before ordering.\n\nTerms and checks before ordering\n\nBespoke enquiries available through sales; appointment required for showroom per FAQ.\n\nChecked on the official website on 17 October 2026. This check did not include placing an order.\n\n[Open official source: Showroom or brand contact, New York, US; remote sales enquiry](https://calicowallpaper.com/about/contact/)\n\n[All makers](https://www.mrwallcover.com/makers/)\n\n## From sample to specification\n\nRecord the exact design and product code, check current instructions and establish the wall preparation before quantities and installation are agreed.\n\n[Discuss your wallcovering](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last updated 18 October 2026\n",
